            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1462, Security Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNormally used in high vandalism areas. When grouted in concrete floors there are no exposed fasteners to remove or tamper with. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Taller <a href=\"/products/security-door-stop-don-jo-1463\"><b>Don-Jo 1463 Security Door Stop</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1462_size.gif?v=1704354537\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1462 Door Stop\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMoulded from flame resistant black rubber around a heavy duty steel stud.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1462 Security Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stop Height: 1-3/8\" (1.375)</li>\r\n<li>Stop Diameter: 2\" (2.000)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length (including stud): 4.400\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Black Rubber</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1462.pdf?v=1704262268\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1462 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
